// postfix_tail's loop condition: is_postfix_start(cur_text(pos)) must be
// re-evaluated every iteration, so it cannot be named once before the loop.
// p1.id already holds 3 functions, and post/ has no room for a sibling
// file, so p1.id was promoted into this directory to make room.

at_postfix_start(int[] pos) {
  string s = cur_text(pos);
  int ok = is_postfix_start(s);
} return int ok;
